  "title": "Justin&#39;s Frosted Chocolate Cone Cakes",
  "description": "Make an easy from-scratch chocolate cake batter and spoon into ice cream cones for fun and chocolatey baked treats. There&#39;s an easy cream cheese frosting for the top, too.",
  "authors": [
    "CHARSIEW"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-18T23:48:02-04:00",
